# ==============================================================================
# Remote State Backend Configuration (S3 + DynamoDB State Locking)
# To enable:
# 1. Run terraform apply inside the bootstrap/ directory to create your bucket & lock table
# 2. Rename this file to backend.tf and fill in your generated bucket name
# 3. Run: terraform init -migrate-state
# ==============================================================================

